From 3a77e966f6f5ec6e4089df6d0bec569edd63d7e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikhail Naganov <mnaganov@google.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Nov 2024 16:39:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 300/436] Make 'IHalAdapterVendorExtension' unstable again

There is no benefit in having this interface as "stable" because
it still does not allow to use 'AServiceManager_isDeclared' for it.
Keeping it as "stable" requires updating all the manifest fragments
of its implementations.

Flag: EXEMPT bugfix
Bug: 378948881
Test: m
(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:e0540ea206eb62feb6920a7945adca545e98eb20)
Merged-In: I040e7bce41d21fa2a63280a7c218c6b68240edcd
Change-Id: I040e7bce41d21fa2a63280a7c218c6b68240edcd
---
 Android.bp                                    | 25 +---------
 aidl_api/av-audio-types-aidl/1/.hash          |  1 -
 .../audio/IHalAdapterVendorExtension.aidl     | 46 -------------------
 .../audio/IHalAdapterVendorExtension.aidl     | 46 -------------------
 media/libaudiohal/impl/Android.bp             |  2 +-
 services/audioparameterparser/Android.bp      |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 119 deletions(-)
